---The properties of the legacy usage detail.
---@class azure.consumption.LegacyUsageDetailProperties
---@field billingAccountId? string Billing Account identifier.
---@field billingAccountName? string Billing Account Name.
---@field billingPeriodStartDate? string The billing period start date.
---@field billingPeriodEndDate? string The billing period end date.
---@field billingProfileId? string Billing Profile identifier.
---@field billingProfileName? string Billing Profile Name.
---@field accountOwnerId? string Account Owner Id.
---@field accountName? string Account Name.
---@field subscriptionId? string Subscription guid.
---@field subscriptionName? string Subscription name.
---@field date? string Date for the usage record.
---@field product? string Product name for the consumed service or purchase. Not available for Marketplace.
---@field partNumber? string Part Number of the service used. Can be used to join with the price sheet. Not available for marketplace.
---@field meterId? string The meter id (GUID). Not available for marketplace. For reserved instance this represents the primary meter for which the reservation was purchased. For the actual VM Size for which the reservation is purchased see productOrderName.
