---@field billingCurrency? string Billing Currency.
---@field resourceLocation? string Resource Location.
---@field consumedService? string Consumed service name. Name of the azure resource provider that emits the usage or was purchased. This value is not provided for marketplace usage.
---@field resourceId? string Unique identifier of the Azure Resource Manager usage detail resource.
---@field resourceName? string Resource Name.
---@field serviceInfo1? string Service-specific metadata.
---@field serviceInfo2? string Legacy field with optional service-specific metadata.
---@field additionalInfo? string Additional details of this usage item. By default this is not populated, unless it's specified in $expand. Use this field to get usage line item specific details such as the actual VM Size (ServiceType) or the ratio in which the reservation discount is applied.
---@field invoiceSection? string Invoice Section Name.
---@field costCenter? string The cost center of this department if it is a department and a cost center is provided.
---@field resourceGroup? string Resource Group Name.
---@field reservationId? string ARM resource id of the reservation. Only applies to records relevant to reservations.
---@field reservationName? string User provided display name of the reservation. Last known name for a particular day is populated in the daily data. Only applies to records relevant to reservations.
---@field productOrderId? string Product Order Id. For reservations this is the Reservation Order ID.
---@field productOrderName? string Product Order Name. For reservations this is the SKU that was purchased.
---@field offerId? string Offer Id. Ex: MS-AZR-0017P, MS-AZR-0148P.
---@field isAzureCreditEligible? boolean Is Azure Credit Eligible.
---@field term? string Term (in months). 1 month for monthly recurring purchase. 12 months for a 1 year reservation. 36 months for a 3 year reservation.
---@field publisherName? string Publisher Name.
---@field publisherType? string Publisher Type.
---@field planName? string Plan Name.
---@field chargeType? string Indicates a charge represents credits, usage, a Marketplace purchase, a reservation fee, or a refund.
---@field frequency? string Indicates how frequently this charge will occur. OneTime for purchases which only happen once, Monthly for fees which recur every month, and UsageBased for charges based on how much a service is used.
---@field payGPrice? number Retail price for the resource.
---@field benefitId? string Unique identifier for the applicable benefit.
---@field benefitName? string Name of the applicable benefit.
---@field pricingModel? azure.consumption.PricingModelType Identifier that indicates how the meter is priced.

