---@class azure.consumption.ListReservationTransactionByBillingProfileRequest
---@field billingAccountId string BillingAccount ID
---@field billingProfileId string Azure Billing Profile ID.
---@field _filter? string Filter reservation transactions by date range. The properties/EventDate for start date and end date. The filter supports 'le' and 'ge'. Note: API returns data for the entire start date's and end date's billing month. For example, filter properties/eventDate+ge+2020-01-01+AND+properties/eventDate+le+2020-12-29 will include data for entire December 2020 month (i.e. will contain records for dates December 30 and 31)

---@class azure.consumption.ListReservationTransactionsRequest
