---@field serviceInfo1? string Service-specific metadata.
---@field serviceInfo2? string Legacy field with optional service-specific metadata.
---@field additionalInfo? string Additional details of this usage item. Use this field to get usage line item specific details such as the actual VM Size (ServiceType) or the ratio in which the reservation discount is applied.
---@field invoiceSectionId? string Identifier of the project that is being charged in the invoice. Not applicable for Microsoft Customer Agreements onboarded by partners.
---@field invoiceSectionName? string Name of the project that is being charged in the invoice. Not applicable for Microsoft Customer Agreements onboarded by partners.
---@field costCenter? string The cost center of this department if it is a department and a cost center is provided.
