---@field productOrderName? string Product Order Name. For reservations this is the SKU that was purchased.
---@field isAzureCreditEligible? boolean Determines if the cost is eligible to be paid for using Azure credits.
---@field term? string Term (in months). Displays the term for the validity of the offer. For example. In case of reserved instances it displays 12 months for yearly term of reserved instance. For one time purchases or recurring purchases, the terms displays 1 month; This is not applicable for Azure consumption.
---@field publisherName? string Name of the publisher of the service including Microsoft or Third Party publishers.
---@field publisherType? string Type of publisher that identifies if the publisher is first party, third party reseller or third party agency.
---@field chargeType? string Indicates a charge represents credits, usage, a Marketplace purchase, a reservation fee, or a refund.
---@field frequency? string Indicates how frequently this charge will occur. OneTime for purchases which only happen once, Monthly for fees which recur every month, and UsageBased for charges based on how much a service is used.
---@field costInBillingCurrency? number ExtendedCost or blended cost before tax in billed currency.
---@field costInPricingCurrency? number ExtendedCost or blended cost before tax in pricing currency to correlate with prices.
---@field exchangeRate? string Exchange rate used in conversion from pricing currency to billing currency.
---@field exchangeRateDate? string Date on which exchange rate used in conversion from pricing currency to billing currency.
---@field invoiceId? string Invoice ID as on the invoice where the specific transaction appears.
---@field previousInvoiceId? string Reference to an original invoice there is a refund (negative cost). This is populated only when there is a refund.
---@field pricingCurrencyCode? string Pricing Billing Currency.
---@field productIdentifier? string Identifier for the product that has accrued charges by consumption or purchase . This is the concatenated key of productId and SkuId in partner center.
