---Details of estimated savings. The costs and savings are estimated for the term.
---@class azure.consumption.ReservationRecommendationDetailsCalculatedSavingsProperties
---@field onDemandCost? number The cost without reservation. Includes hardware and software cost.
---@field overageCost? number The estimated cost for resource meters that are not covered by the reservation and are billed at pay-as-you-go rates.
---@field quantity? number The quantity for calculated savings.
---@field reservationCost? number Hardware cost of the resources covered by the reservation.
---@field totalReservationCost? number Reservation cost + software cost of the resources covered by the reservation + overage cost.
---@field reservedUnitCount? number The number of reserved units used to calculate savings. Always 1 for virtual machines.
---@field savings? number The amount saved by purchasing the recommended quantity of reservation. This is equal to onDemandCost - totalReservationCost.

